   ✋ ConstraintError: could not clone tpm to <fixture>/home/.tmux/plugins/tpm
      ⇒ ~/.tmux.conf names that exact path in its 'run' line, so tmux
        will start with NO plugins and print a run-shell error on every
        session — which reads as a broken conf rather than an absent tool
      ⇒ the path is part of the contract; do not move it elsewhere
      ⇒ git_clone named the fault above, and it already removed the
        partial dir. a kill it cannot observe would leave one — and the
        guard above reads state rather than presence, so a re-run moves
        that carcass aside instead of a report of ✔ over it
